            <div xml:id="d484">

                <pb facs="0612" n="527" sameAs="frus:frus1919v02/pg527"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">882.77/31: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Chargé in
                        Liberia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Bundy</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-10-01T18:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">October 1,
                                1919, 6 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Your September 25, 2 p.m.</p>
                <p>You may suggest to Liberian Government that for the present and until the
                    conclusion of loan agreement negotiations they may not wish to give definite
                    consideration to such applications.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Phillips</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
